      "type": "text",
      "text": "PAH: vasodilators: PDE-5 inhibitors (tadalafil 40 mg daily, sildenafil 20 mg PO 3 times daily), ERAs (bosentan 62.5-125 mg twice daily, ambrisentan, macitentan), and/or prostacyclin analogs (epoprostenol, treprostinil, iloprost 2.5-5 μg inhaled 6-9 times daily); prostacyclins considered most effective; all improve hemodynamics and QOL."
     }
